axolotlextras.rc.icons=Show Item Icons
axolotlextras.rc.enderChest=Show Ender Chest
axolotlextras.rc.enderChest.tooltip=The ender chest count is what it held the last time you opened it.
axolotlextras.rc.total=Show Total
axolotlextras.rc.onlyBedWars=Only In Bed Wars
axolotlextras.rc.onlyBedWars.tooltip=Hides the counter outside Hypixel Bed Wars.
axolotlextras.ignoreServerBlocks=Ignore Server Blocks
axolotlextras.ignoreServerBlocks.tooltip=Stops AxolotlClient from switching Freelook, Toggle Sneak, Time Changer, Full Bright and Low Fire off on certain servers. Servers may still have their own rules about these mods.
axolotlextras.toggleWithoutHud=Toggle Sprint Without HUD
axolotlextras.toggleWithoutHud.tooltip=Keeps the Toggle Sprint key working when the Toggle Sprint HUD module is switched off. The "Toggle Sprint" option inside that module still has to be on.
upgradedisplay=Upgrade Display
axolotlextras.ud.onlyBedWars=Only In Bed Wars
axolotlextras.ud.onlyBedWars.tooltip=Hides the list outside Hypixel Bed Wars.
axolotlextras.ud.showCost=Show Next Price
axolotlextras.ud.showCost.tooltip=Shows the diamond price of the next tier on the right. Only known prices are shown.
axolotlextras.ud.mode=Team Size
axolotlextras.ud.mode.tooltip=Prices differ between solo/doubles and 3v3v3v3/4v4v4v4. Auto reads it from the Bed Wars sidebar and shows no prices until it can tell.
auto=Auto
small_teams=Solo / Doubles
big_teams=3v3v3v3 / 4v4v4v4
axolotlextras.kdrLevelHead=KDR Level Head
axolotlextras.kdrLevelHead.tooltip=Shows each player's kill/death ratio above their head in Bed Wars, in place of the stat chosen in the Bed Wars options. Needs a Hypixel API key, nothing is shown without real stats.
axolotlextras.kdrTab=KDR In Tab
axolotlextras.kdrTab.tooltip=Shows each player's kill/death ratio next to their health in the Bed Wars tab list. Needs a Hypixel API key.
