axolotlextras.section.oldvisuals=1.7 visuals
axolotlextras.oldBlockHitting=Block Hitting
axolotlextras.oldBlockHitting.tooltip=The sword, food and bow animations keep swinging when you swing while holding right click, like in 1.7.
axolotlextras.oldFirstPerson=1.7 Item Positions
axolotlextras.oldFirstPerson.tooltip=Held items sit in your hand the way they did in 1.7: the position and size of items and blocks, the bow pose and the fishing rod.
axolotlextras.oldSneak=1.7 Sneaking
axolotlextras.oldSneak.tooltip=The camera goes down at once when you sneak and comes back up slowly when you stop, like in 1.7.
axolotlextras.oldThirdPerson=1.7 Sword Block (outside view)
axolotlextras.oldThirdPerson.tooltip=How other players and the third person camera see a blocking sword: the arm straight up in front and the sword turned, like in 1.7.
axolotlextras.reliableStats=Reliable Bed Wars Stats
axolotlextras.reliableStats.tooltip=Loads every player's Bed Wars stats from Hypixel at the start of a game, a few at a time, and asks again after a failure. Without it AxolotlClient asks once and most players stay at a question mark. Needs a Hypixel API key in the AxolotlClient settings.
